# Docker build context = repo root (render.yaml dockerContext: .). The image
# COPYs only backend/ + prompts/, so everything else is either context bloat
# (.git, node_modules, venv) or data that must NEVER reach an image built
# locally: the dev SQLite DB and the UNTRACKED client PDF fixtures. Render
# builds from a git checkout, so untracked files are absent there — this file
# protects local `docker build` runs (and keeps their context upload small).
.git
.claude
**/__pycache__
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.db
venv
frontend
docs
detector_bench

# Untracked runtime/dev data under backend/. Tracked runtime files stay in:
# backend/data/email_templates/ and backend/data/lt_unit_prices.json.
backend/data/samatu.db
backend/data/pdf_store
backend/data/cv_cache
backend/data/annotations
backend/data/calibrations
backend/data/demo-berzu-24-snapshot-20260714.json
backend/test_pdfs
backend/logs
